capability text/rfc3339-write  an instant written as RFC 3339
  heroes  time.format
  go      time.RFC3339, time.RFC3339Nano, Time.Format, Time.String, Time.MarshalText, Time.MarshalJSON, Time.AppendText, Time.AppendFormat
  rust    -
